      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리의 오물에 손대지 마!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9ACC7580020C624BB3CC5D00020C190B300C9C00020B9C8002100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "요즘 도시에\n오물이 자주 보이지 않아?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C694C9980020B3C4C2DCC5D0000AC624BB3CC7740020C790C8FC0020BCF4C774C9C00020C54AC544003F00100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저기, 저런 거 말이야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800AE30002C0020C800B7F00020AC700020B9D0C774C57C002E00100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저걸 보고 기가 막힌 아이디어가 떠올랐어.\n오물 청소로 크게 벌 수 있을 거라고 말이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800AC780020BCF4ACE00020AE30AC000020B9C9D78C0020C544C774B514C5B4AC000020B5A0C62CB790C5B4002E000AC624BB3C0020CCADC18CB85C0020D06CAC8C0020BC8C0020C2180020C788C7440020AC70B77CACE00020B9D0C774C57C002100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서, 물대포를 잘 쏠 것 같은 완철포를\n파트너로 만들어서 준비하고 있었어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C002C0020BB3CB300D3ECB97C0020C7980020C3E00020AC830020AC19C7400020C644CCA0D3ECB97C000AD30CD2B8B108B85C0020B9CCB4E4C5B4C11C0020C900BE44D558ACE00020C788C5C8C5B4002E00100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데 영 글러 먹은 거 있지!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n완철포 이 녀석,\n오물을 씻어 낼 생각이 전혀 없더라고.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B3700020C6010020AE00B7EC0020BA39C7400020AC700020C788C9C0002100100001BE01000AC644CCA0D3EC0020C7740020B140C11D002C000AC624BB3CC7440020C53BC5B40020B0BC0020C0DDAC01C7740020C804D6000020C5C6B354B77CACE0002E00100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기샤!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C0E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너에게 부탁이 있어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108C5D0AC8C0020BD80D0C1C7740020C788C5B4002100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 완철포에게 시범을 보여 줘.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n네 포켓몬의 물대포로\n오물을 씻어 내는 멋진 모습을 말이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020C644CCA0D3ECC5D0AC8C0020C2DCBC94C7440020BCF4C5EC0020C918002E00100001BE01000AB1240020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020BB3CB300D3ECB85C000AC624BB3CC7440020C53BC5B40020B0B4B2940020BA4BC9C40020BAA8C2B5C7440020B9D0C774C57C002100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 완철포에게 시범을 보여 줘.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n네 포켓몬의 물대포로\n오물을 씻어 내는 멋진 모습을 말이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020C644CCA0D3ECC5D0AC8C0020C2DCBC94C7440020BCF4C5EC0020C918002E00100001BE01000AB1240020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020BB3CB300D3ECB85C000AC624BB3CC7440020C53BC5B40020B0B4B2940020BA4BC9C40020BAA8C2B5C7440020B9D0C774C57C002100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠깐!\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>물대포<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>로 씻어 내는 걸 보여 달라니까!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0AE500021000A00100002FF000006BB3CB300D3EC00100002FF000000B85C0020C53BC5B40020B0B4B2940020AC780020BCF4C5EC0020B2ECB77CB2C8AE4C002100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
