      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오오!\n깔끔하게 씻어 냈잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C6240021000AAE54B054D558AC8C0020C53BC5B40020B0C8C796C544002100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "완철포! 너도 봤지?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n저렇게 물대포를 발사해서\n오물을 깔끔하게 씻어 내면 돼.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C644CCA0D3EC00210020B108B3C40020BD24C9C0003F00100001BE01000AC800B807AC8C0020BB3CB300D3ECB97C0020BC1CC0ACD574C11C000AC624BB3CC7440020AE54B054D558AC8C0020C53BC5B40020B0B4BA740020B3FC002E00100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기샤.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C0E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바위가 아니라\n오물에 사용해야지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14C704AC000020C544B2C8B77C000AC624BB3CC5D00020C0ACC6A9D574C57CC9C0002100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기샤!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C0E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "물대포로 바위를 부쉈잖아!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB3CB300D3ECB85C0020BC14C704B97C0020BD80C248C796C5440021003F00100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "완철포, 너 제법인데!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C644CCA0D3EC002C0020B1080020C81CBC95C778B370002100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기샤!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C0E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네가 오물은\n쳐다도 안 보는 이유가 뭔지 이제 알겠어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124AC000020C624BB3CC740000ACCD0B2E4B3C40020C5480020BCF4B2940020C774C720AC000020BB54C9C00020C774C81C0020C54CACA0C5B4002E00100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만 오물 청소는\n반드시 해야만 해!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC0020C624BB3C0020CCADC18CB294000ABC18B4DCC2DC0020D574C57CB9CC0020D574002100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기샤?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C0E4003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오물 청소뿐만이 아니야!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n너의 그 뛰어난 파워를 살려서\n포켓몬 승부의 세계에도 도전해 보자!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624BB3C0020CCADC18CBFD0B9CCC7740020C544B2C8C57C002100100001BE01000AB108C7580020ADF80020B6F0C5B4B09C0020D30CC6CCB97C0020C0B4B824C11C000AD3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80C7580020C138ACC4C5D0B3C40020B3C4C804D5740020BCF4C790002100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이것저것 도전하면서 모든 부문의\n정점에 서는 거야! 어때, 파트너?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AC83C800AC830020B3C4C804D558BA74C11C0020BAA8B4E00020BD80BB38C758000AC815C810C5D00020C11CB2940020AC70C57C00210020C5B4B54C002C0020D30CD2B8B108003F00100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고마워!\n네 덕분에 완철포의 잠재력을 알게 됐어.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n우리의 세계가 더 넓어진 것 같은 기분이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B9C8C6CC0021000AB1240020B355BD84C5D00020C644CCA0D3ECC7580020C7A0C7ACB825C7440020C54CAC8C0020B410C5B4002E00100001BE00000AC6B0B9ACC7580020C138ACC4AC000020B3540020B113C5B4C9C40020AC830020AC19C7400020AE30BD84C774C57C002100100002011401860000",
